        <mxCell id="n2" value="&lt;b&gt;M:N resolution:&lt;/b&gt; TOOL_REQUIREMENT uses composite PK (tool_id, cert_id). MEMBER_CERTIFICATION uses composite PK (member_id, cert_id).&lt;br/&gt;BORROWING has borrow_id so the same member can borrow the same tool more than once." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#FB923C;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#7C2D12;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
